But refreshToken is async and racey when called concurrently. Request: Refactor to single-flight refresh using a Promise cache (inFlightRefresh) so concurrent calls wait for the same refresh and don't trigger multiple refreshes. Also add tests asserting concurrency doesn't produce duplicated network calls. Provide sketch:

let inFlightRefresh: Promise<void> | null = null;
