The project import wizard currently conflates parsing, validation, and persistence in one 700-line file. Split into modules: parser (pure), validator (pure, schema-based), and repository (side effects). Add integration tests that stub the repository. Eliminate side effects from unit-testable code.

Watch out for this anti-pattern:

